  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) augmentation de la fourniture d&apos;une assistance &#xe0; la protection sensible au genre, pour r&#xe9;pondre aux besoins primaires des femmes et des enfants vuln&#xe9;rables rapatri&#xe9;s en Ha&#xef;ti; 2) am&#xe9;lioration de l&apos;acc&#xe8;s aux services de protection et &#xe0; la prise de d&#xe9;cision &#xe9;clair&#xe9;e par les femmes et les enfants vuln&#xe9;rables rapatri&#xe9;s en Ha&#xef;ti; 3) am&#xe9;lioration de l&apos;acc&#xe8;s aux opportunit&#xe9;s &#xe9;conomiques et renforcement des moyens de subsistance des femmes et des enfants ha&#xef;tiens vuln&#xe9;rables, rapatri&#xe9;s et soumis &#xe0; des risques de protection.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes for this project include: (1) increased provision of gender responsive protection assistance to address the primary needs of vulnerable repatriated women and children in Haiti; (2) improved access to protective services and informed decision-making by vulnerable repatriated women and children in Haiti; (3) improved access to economic opportunities and strengthened livelihoods for vulnerable repatriated Haitian women and children subject to protection risks.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
